OL,3,GNEWSAFive arrested as counter-terror
OL,4,Apolice investigate major incident near
OL,5,ARAF Fairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FCounter-terror police are leading the
OL,8,Finvestigation. An Army explosive
OL,9,Fordnance disposal team has been
OL,10,Fexamining vehicles near the base, which
OL,11,Fis used by the United States Air Force
OL,12,F(USAF).
OL,14,FEighty-five households in the nearby
OL,15,Fvillage of Whelford have been evacuated
OL,16,Fwhile investigations continue.
OL,17,FOfficials believe the incident is
OL,18,Fcontained.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
